    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AEONS AND AEONS HAS IT BEEN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AN OLD STORY TOLD AGAIN AND AGAIN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PERHAPS IN FEAR OF THE LOVING ONE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IT THAT SHAPED THIS WORLD,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THIS STORY WAS FORGOTTEN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUT BE AS IT MAY, NOTHING,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOR NO ONE, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAN PROVE THE TRUTH OF THIS STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CENTRE OF THIS WORLD, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE AXIS OF THE WORLD-PLATE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SURROUNDED BY A SCORCHING DESERT, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ITSELF BY A LUSH WASTELAND</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ITSELF BY FOGGY HILLS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ITSELF BY A COLD AND DESOLATE DARKNESS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNDER THE DIRECT LIGHT OF THE EGG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAND, TALL, UNKNOWN, UNCLIMBED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE TOWER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUST YOU CLIMB ? MUST YOU FORSAKE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALL THAT YOU HAVE KNOWN, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TO ENTER THE BLACK TEMPLE ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU MUST, FOR TO CHANGE THIS WORLD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVERYTHING MUST BE LOST,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SO THAT EVERYTHING CAN BE GAINED.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU KNOW THIS DEEP INSIDE AND HAVE KNOWN IT FOR YEARS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOUR ENTIRE LIFE YOU HAVE SWORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THAT ONE DAY, THIS LAND SHALL HOLD STILL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IN PEACE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WITHOUT PLAGUE AND ILLNESS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POVERTY OR WAR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVERYTHING PRECIOUS TO YOU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUST BE LOST, TO THEN BE GAINED.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND SO YOU ENTER.</p>",
